From: Alp Lab AB <contact@alplab.ai>
Date: Wed, 4 Jun 2026 12:01:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] backport: genetlink: 4-arg genlmsg_multicast_allns() shim

Copyright (c) 2026 Alp Lab AB
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0

Backport-shim for building the Murata cyw-fmac backports tree (base
v6.1.97, branch imx-mickledore-jaculus) against a 6.1.141 (cip43) target
kernel.

genlmsg_multicast_allns() lost its trailing gfp_t flags argument in
mainline v6.8 (commit b8fd6008ad48); that change was backported into the
6.1.x stable series at 6.1.79. This backports tree still carries call
sites (bundled nl80211.c) that pass the old 5th argument, so it fails to
compile against any kernel that already has the 4-argument prototype --
which includes the 6.1.141 cip43 target here. Add a version-guarded
wrapper that drops the flags argument on kernels with the 4-arg form, so
the bundled call sites keep compiling unchanged.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [kernel-version backport shim; belongs in
the Murata backports tree's own backport-include, not the distro layer]

Signed-off-by: Alp Lab AB <contact@alplab.ai>
---
 backport-include/net/genetlink.h | 22 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 22 insertions(+)

diff --git a/backport-include/net/genetlink.h b/backport-include/net/genetlink.h
index 016e96c..bae9839 100644
--- a/backport-include/net/genetlink.h
+++ b/backport-include/net/genetlink.h
@@ -172,4 +172,26 @@ static inline int genlmsg_parse(const struct nlmsghdr *nlh,
 }
 #endif /* LINUX_VERSION_IS_LESS(5,2,0) */

+/*
+ * genlmsg_multicast_allns() lost its trailing gfp_t flags argument in
+ * mainline v6.8 (commit b8fd6008ad48) and the change was backported into the
+ * 6.1.x stable series at 6.1.79.  This backports tree (v6.1.97 base) still
+ * carries call sites that pass the old 5th argument.  When building against a
+ * kernel that already has the 4-argument prototype, provide a variadic-style
+ * shim that drops the flags argument so the bundled nl80211.c keeps compiling.
+ */
+#if (LINUX_VERSION_IS_GEQ(6,1,79) && LINUX_VERSION_IS_LESS(6,2,0)) || \
+    LINUX_VERSION_IS_GEQ(6,8,0)
+static inline int backport_genlmsg_multicast_allns_noflags(
+		const struct genl_family *family, struct sk_buff *skb,
+		u32 portid, unsigned int group, gfp_t flags)
+{
+	(void)flags;
+	return genlmsg_multicast_allns(family, skb, portid, group);
+}
+#undef genlmsg_multicast_allns
+#define genlmsg_multicast_allns(family, skb, portid, group, flags) \
+	backport_genlmsg_multicast_allns_noflags(family, skb, portid, group, flags)
+#endif /* 4-arg genlmsg_multicast_allns kernels */
+
 #endif /* __BACKPORT_NET_GENETLINK_H */
--
2.43.0
